        <div class="tl-item reveal"><div class="tl-day">Friday · Sept 18</div><h3>Cascade Expo opens</h3><p>Bib pickup, gear from 60+ brands, and the elite athlete panel at the Portland Convention Center.</p><span class="tl-time">10:00 AM – 8:00 PM</span></div>
