        <div class="tl-item reveal"><div class="tl-day">Sunday · Sept 20</div><h3>Marathon start</h3><p>Wave starts from the foothills village. Sunrise gun, net-downhill miles, Pacific finish.</p><span class="tl-time">6:45 AM</span></div>
        <div class="tl-item reveal"><div class="tl-day">Sunday · Sept 20</div><h3>Finish festival</h3><p>Boardwalk celebration at Pacific City — local food, live music, and ocean-side recovery zone.</p><span class="tl-time">9:30 AM – 3:00 PM</span></div>
